        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cooking "
          },
          {
            "type": "glossaryTooltip",
            "attrs": {
              "termSlug": "sea-bass"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "glossaryTooltip",
            "attrs": {
              "termSlug": "al-forno"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " means roasting it directly over the potatoes so the fish juices drip down and flavour everything underneath. The key technique is to par-cook the potatoes first so they are tender by the time the fish is ready. This recipe serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use good sea bass fillets with skin on . the skin crisps in the oven and protects the flesh from drying out."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
